    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6932" root="حبش" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأُحْبُوشُ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَبَشُ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُحْبُوشٌ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبَاشَةٌ</span>:
accord. to some, it signifies <i>Any company,</i> or
<i>body, of men;</i> because, when they are collected
together, they are [in their general hue] black.
